The instructions for this repo are in [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) — tool-neutral and written for any
AI assistant. Read it first, then [INDEX.md](mdc:INDEX.md), the map of every file.

Short version: never invent numbers (read them from a run's `summary.json`); never edit `raw/`;
update `INDEX.md` when you add a file; work on `<handle>/<topic>` branches; run `make check`
before claiming you are done.
